.Dd @MAN_DATE@
.Dt GLYPHASTORE_REPAIR_STORE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glyphastore_repair_store
.Nd offline repair of a GlyphaStore data directory into a workspace
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hV
.Op Fl Fl json
.Op Fl Fl no-scan
.Ar source-data-dir workspace-dir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
performs offline fail-closed repair that never mutates the source (GlyphaStore
.Sy @PROJECT_VERSION@ ) .
It requires an empty explicit workspace and creates:
.Bl -tag -width "workspace/quarantine" -compact
.It Pa workspace/store
Clean Manifest and catalog Segments (verified after copy).
.It Pa workspace/quarantine
Non-catalog namespace anomalies plus
.Pa audit.txt .
.El
.Pp
Unlisted Segments, crash temporaries, compaction intents, and unknown regular
files are quarantined.
Missing catalog entries and unsafe entries (symlinks, hard links, non-regular
objects) fail closed without writing a usable store.
Live/hot repair is not supported.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl Fl help
Show help and exit 0.
.It Fl V , Fl Fl version
Show version and exit 0.
.It Fl Fl json
Emit a stable JSON report on stdout.
.It Fl Fl no-scan
Skip committed Record scans during catalog verification.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Success.
.It 1
Repair or I/O failure.
.It 2
Usage error.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr glyphastore 7 ,
.Xr glyphastore_verify_store 1 ,
.Xr glyphastore_rebuild_index 1
.Sh AUTHORS
GlyphaStore contributors.
